#. command help: didact capture
#: didact/commands/play.py
msgid ""
"Appends one turn to the open session's transcript. Claude Code hooks pipe their JSON:\n"
"UserPromptSubmit (`prompt`) records the player, Stop (`last_assistant_message`) the GM.\n"
"The first captured turn after `session start` binds the transcript to that Claude\n"
"session; turns from other sessions are ignored. With no open session it does nothing."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan satu giliran ke transkrip sesi yang terbuka. Hook Claude Code mengalirkan\n"
"JSON-nya: UserPromptSubmit (`prompt`) mencatat pemain, Stop (`last_assistant_message`)\n"
"mencatat GM. Giliran pertama yang ditangkap setelah `session start` mengikat transkrip\n"
"ke sesi Claude tersebut; giliran dari sesi lain diabaikan. Tanpa sesi terbuka, perintah\n"
"ini tidak melakukan apa pun."

