#. command help: didact about
#: didact/commands/knowledge.py
msgid ""
"Details are short named notes for whoever runs the game; keep them current and the\n"
"game stays consistent. Suggested names depend on the record (looks, personality,\n"
"wants, fears, attitude, doing, plan, where, history, powers, state, secret,\n"
"thoughts); any one-word name works. `thoughts` is for your own ideas about what you\n"
"made. Players see only `looks`; `reveal <record> <name>` shows them another.\n"
"Without values: the details, the suggestions still open, the record's chronicle\n"
"(journal beats `--about` it), what it holds and where it is. This view is for the GM."
msgstr ""
"Detail adalah catatan singkat bernama untuk siapa pun yang menjalankan permainan;\n"
"perbarui terus dan permainan tetap konsisten. Nama yang disarankan bergantung pada\n"
"entrinya (looks, personality, wants, fears, attitude, doing, plan, where, history,\n"
"powers, state, secret, thoughts); nama satu kata apa pun bisa dipakai. `thoughts` untuk\n"
"ide Anda sendiri tentang apa yang Anda buat. Pemain hanya melihat `looks`;\n"
"`reveal <record> <name>` menunjukkan detail lain kepada mereka. Tanpa nilai: detailnya,\n"
"saran yang masih terbuka, kronik entri (peristiwa jurnal yang `--about` entri itu), apa\n"
"yang dibawanya, dan di mana ia berada. Tampilan ini untuk GM."

