#. command help: didact batch
#: didact/commands/meta.py
msgid ""
"Each line is a didact command (with or without the word `didact`); `#` starts a\n"
"comment. --home, --world, --campaign and --detail pass on to every line. It stops at\n"
"the first failure unless --keep-going. With --format json you get one result per line."
msgstr ""
"Setiap baris adalah perintah didact (dengan atau tanpa kata `didact`); `#` memulai\n"
"komentar. --home, --world, --campaign, dan --detail diteruskan ke setiap baris. Berhenti\n"
"pada kegagalan pertama kecuali dengan --keep-going. Dengan --format json Anda mendapat\n"
"satu hasil per baris."

#: didact/web/pages/journal.py
msgid "Each session keeps its scenes, beats and rolls."
