#. command help: didact reset
#: didact/commands/care.py
msgid "Empty the library, as if Didact were newly installed (shown first; backed up first)"
msgstr "Kosongkan pustaka, seolah Didact baru dipasang (ditampilkan dulu; dicadangkan dulu)"

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid ""
"Empty the library, as if Didact were newly installed: every world, campaign and change goes, and "
"numbering starts again at #e1. A backup is made first, and backups stay."
msgstr ""
"Kosongkan pustaka, seolah Didact baru dipasang: semua dunia, kampanye, dan perubahan hilang, dan "
"penomoran dimulai lagi dari #e1. Cadangan dibuat terlebih dahulu, dan cadangan tetap ada."

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Aktifkan"

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid ""
"Enabling a pack adds it to the open campaign. The core pack is always on, and one game system is "
"in use at a time: the open world's, which it keeps for good."
msgstr ""
"Mengaktifkan paket menambahkannya ke kampanye yang terbuka. Paket core selalu aktif, dan hanya "
"satu sistem permainan yang dipakai dalam satu waktu: sistem milik dunia yang terbuka, yang "
"dipertahankannya untuk selamanya."

#: didact/web/pages/overview.py
msgid "End session"
msgstr "Akhiri sesi"

#. command help: didact scene end
#: didact/commands/play.py
msgid "End the current scene (optionally with its summary)"
msgstr "Akhiri adegan saat ini (opsional dengan ringkasannya)"

#. command help: didact combat end
#: didact/commands/combat.py
msgid "End the fight"
msgstr "Akhiri pertarungan"

#. command help: didact session end
#: didact/commands/play.py
msgid "End the session (give its summary now, or later with `summary write session`)"
msgstr "Akhiri sesi (berikan ringkasannya sekarang, atau nanti dengan `summary write session`)"

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid ""
"Every change, newest first. Undo takes the last one back, or pick one; jump back to a change to "
"take back everything after it."
msgstr ""
"Semua perubahan, terbaru di atas. Urungkan membatalkan yang terakhir, atau pilih salah satu; "
"lompat kembali ke sebuah perubahan untuk membatalkan semua yang terjadi setelahnya."

#. command help: didact faction turn
#: didact/commands/tracking.py
msgid ""
"Every faction that isn't gone takes a turn: the system's `settings.factions.turn`\n"
"rule, or a roll (d6; 4+ ticks each of its clocks: `track new … --for faction:x`).\n"
"Narrate the moves from their agendas. Secret factions act too; `--gm` shows them."
msgstr ""
"Setiap faksi yang belum lenyap mendapat giliran: aturan `settings.factions.turn` sistem,\n"
"atau lemparan (d6; 4+ memajukan setiap jamnya: `track new … --for faction:x`). Narasikan\n"
"langkah mereka dari agenda masing-masing. Faksi rahasia juga bertindak; `--gm`\n"
"menampilkannya."

#: didact/web/pages/settings.py
msgid "Every module's documentation, from its docstrings and types."
msgstr "Dokumentasi setiap modul, dari docstring dan tipenya."

#. command help: didact gen run
#: didact/commands/drafts.py
msgid ""
"Every roll is logged. `--prefill` gives decisions in advance (a choice takes the\n"
"option it names; a list gives one value per occurrence); `--auto` lets the dice make\n"
"the choices the procedure would otherwise ask about. Then `gen show`, `gen edit`,\n"
"`gen commit`."
msgstr ""
"Setiap lemparan dicatat. `--prefill` memberikan keputusan di muka (pilihan mengambil\n"
"opsi yang disebutkan; daftar memberi satu nilai per kemunculan); `--auto` membiarkan\n"
"dadu menentukan pilihan yang sebaliknya akan ditanyakan prosedur. Lalu `gen show`,\n"
"`gen edit`, `gen commit`."

#: didact/web/pages/graph.py
msgid "Every type is switched off: turn one on above."
msgstr "Semua tipe dinonaktifkan: aktifkan salah satu di atas."

#. command help: didact reset
#: didact/commands/care.py
msgid ""
"Every world, campaign and record goes, with the history, drafts, save points and the\n"
"search index, and numbering starts again: the next change is #e1, the next roll #r1.\n"
"The backups stay, and so do installed packs unless --packs. The library as it is is\n"
"backed up first (snapshot-<time>-before-reset.zip): undo can't take a reset back, but\n"
"restoring that backup can. Without --yes it only shows what would go."
msgstr ""
"Setiap dunia, kampanye, dan entri hilang, beserta riwayat, draf, titik simpan, dan\n"
"indeks pencarian, dan penomoran dimulai lagi: perubahan berikutnya #e1, lemparan\n"
"berikutnya #r1. Cadangan tetap ada, begitu pula paket yang terpasang kecuali dengan\n"
"--packs. Pustaka dicadangkan dulu apa adanya (snapshot-<time>-before-reset.zip):\n"
"urungkan tidak dapat membatalkan penyetelan ulang, tetapi memulihkan cadangan itu bisa.\n"
"Tanpa --yes perintah ini hanya menampilkan apa yang akan hilang."

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid ""
"Everything after it is taken back, newest first: each change is undone, and each roll is marked "
"undone. Nothing is deleted: Redo, or jumping back to a later change, brings it back."
msgstr ""
"Semua yang terjadi setelahnya dibatalkan, mulai dari yang terbaru: setiap perubahan diurungkan, "
"dan setiap lemparan ditandai diurungkan. Tidak ada yang dihapus: Ulangi, atau lompat kembali ke "
"perubahan yang lebih baru, akan mengembalikannya."

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid "Everything but the newest ones you keep goes for good: this can't be undone."
msgstr "Semua kecuali yang terbaru yang Anda simpan akan hilang selamanya: ini tidak dapat diurungkan."

#: didact/web/pages/library.py
msgid ""
"Everything in the library but its backups is replaced by the backup's. The library as it is now "
"is backed up first: undo can't take a restore back, but restoring that backup can."
msgstr ""
"Semua isi pustaka kecuali cadangannya diganti dengan isi cadangan. Pustaka saat ini dicadangkan "
"terlebih dahulu: pemulihan tidak dapat diurungkan, tetapi dapat dibalik dengan memulihkan "
"cadangan tersebut."

#. command help: didact world delete
#: didact/commands/library.py
msgid ""
"Everything in the world goes: its records, maps, lore and every campaign in it\n"
"(sessions, journals, transcripts, oracle state). Without --yes it shows what would\n"
"go and stages the change for `didact apply <id>`. `didact undo` brings it all back,\n"
"byte for byte. The event log keeps its history either way."
msgstr ""
"Semua isi dunia hilang: entri, peta, lore, dan setiap kampanye di dalamnya (sesi,\n"
"jurnal, transkrip, status orakel). Tanpa --yes perintah ini menampilkan apa yang akan\n"
"hilang dan menyiapkan perubahan untuk `didact apply <id>`. `didact undo` mengembalikan\n"
"semuanya, byte demi byte. Log peristiwa tetap menyimpan riwayatnya dalam kedua kasus."

