#. command help: didact log
#: didact/commands/play.py
msgid ""
"Kinds and their marks: action @, oracle ?, roll d:, result ->, consequence =>,\n"
"narration, dialogue, note, ooc. Log beats, not prose dumps: one line per thing\n"
"that happened. Rolls are in the log already; link them with --roll.\n"
"--about names the records a beat concerns: it joins each one's chronicle (`show`,\n"
"`about`), so what someone did, or what happened to a thing, stays on record.\n"
"--secret: it happened out of the players' sight (GM views only)."
msgstr ""
"Jenis dan tandanya: action @, oracle ?, roll d:, result ->, consequence =>, narration,\n"
"dialogue, note, ooc. Catat peristiwa, bukan tumpukan prosa: satu baris untuk setiap hal\n"
"yang terjadi. Lemparan sudah ada di log; tautkan dengan --roll. --about menyebut entri\n"
"yang terkait dengan peristiwa: peristiwa itu masuk ke kronik masing-masing (`show`,\n"
"`about`), sehingga apa yang dilakukan seseorang, atau apa yang menimpa sesuatu, tetap\n"
"tercatat. --secret: terjadi di luar pandangan pemain (hanya tampilan GM)."

