#. command help: didact pack test
#: didact/commands/packs.py
msgid "Run a pack's tests: table rolls, expressions, odds and smoke-play scripts"
msgstr "Jalankan pengujian paket: lemparan tabel, ekspresi, peluang, dan skrip uji main"

#. command help: didact do
#: didact/commands/rules.py
msgid ""
"Run a rule from the enabled packs with name=value parameters (a flag can stand alone:\n"
"`protect` is `protect=true`). Dice are rolled and logged, changes are applied as one\n"
"undoable change, and prompts tell you what to\n"
"narrate or decide. A roll that allows push/burn/reroll comes back pending: finish it\n"
"with `didact resolve <roll> <option>`."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan aturan dari paket yang aktif dengan parameter name=value (flag bisa berdiri\n"
"sendiri: `protect` berarti `protect=true`). Dadu dilempar dan dicatat, perubahan\n"
"diterapkan sebagai satu perubahan yang dapat diurungkan, dan pertanyaan pemandu memberi\n"
"tahu apa yang perlu Anda narasikan atau putuskan. Lemparan yang mengizinkan\n"
"push/burn/reroll kembali dalam status tertunda: selesaikan dengan\n"
"`didact resolve <roll> <option>`."

#. command help: didact do
#: didact/commands/rules.py
msgid "Run a rule: a check, action, procedure or trigger (rules as function calls)"
msgstr "Jalankan aturan: pemeriksaan, aksi, prosedur, atau pemicu (aturan sebagai pemanggilan fungsi)"

#: didact/web/pages/commands.py didact/web/pages/reference.py
msgid "Run it"
msgstr "Jalankan"

#. command help: didact batch
#: didact/commands/meta.py
msgid "Run several commands in one call: one per line, from stdin or a file"
msgstr "Jalankan beberapa perintah dalam satu panggilan: satu per baris, dari stdin atau berkas"

#. command help: didact serve
#: didact/commands/web.py
msgid ""
"Runs a small web app on this machine until Ctrl-C: records, a graph of their links,\n"
"the journal, rules and tables, the library, and every command as a form. Changes run\n"
"the same commands as the command line, so they are checked, logged and undoable, and\n"
"each one shows its command line. Secrets stay hidden unless the GM view is on (--gm\n"
"starts with it on). It listens on 127.0.0.1 only unless --host says otherwise.\n"
"\n"
"--demo serves the sample campaign (`didact sample`) from a library of its own, with\n"
"every pack that ships with Didact installed, built afresh each time it starts: a place\n"
"to try things without touching your own.\n"
"More: `didact guide web`."
msgstr ""
"Menjalankan aplikasi web kecil di mesin ini sampai Ctrl-C: entri, graf tautannya,\n"
"jurnal, aturan dan tabel, pustaka, dan setiap perintah sebagai formulir. Perubahan\n"
"menjalankan perintah yang sama dengan baris perintah, sehingga diperiksa, dicatat, dan\n"
"dapat diurungkan, dan masing-masing menampilkan baris perintahnya. Rahasia tetap\n"
"tersembunyi kecuali tampilan GM aktif (--gm memulainya dalam keadaan aktif). Hanya\n"
"mendengarkan di 127.0.0.1 kecuali --host menentukan lain.\n"
"\n"
"--demo menyajikan kampanye contoh (`didact sample`) dari pustakanya sendiri yang\n"
"dibangun baru setiap kali dimulai, dengan semua paket bawaan Didact terpasang: tempat\n"
"untuk mencoba tanpa menyentuh pustaka Anda sendiri.\n"
"Selengkapnya: `didact guide web`."

#. command help: didact cache clear
#: didact/commands/library.py
msgid ""
"Safe any time: your library's files are the truth. The next command rebuilds the\n"
"search index of the library it opens, and packs recompile as they load. It touches\n"
"nothing else: not the library, not other files in the cache folder, and not what\n"
"`pack build` wrote into a pack's `.build/` folder. For the developer caches in a\n"
"checkout of Didact (mypy, ruff, pytest, pack builds), use `make clean`."
msgstr ""
"Aman kapan saja: berkas pustaka Anda adalah sumber kebenarannya. Perintah berikutnya\n"
"membangun ulang indeks pencarian pustaka yang dibukanya, dan paket dikompilasi ulang\n"
"saat dimuat. Tidak ada hal lain yang disentuh: bukan pustaka, bukan berkas lain di\n"
"folder cache, dan bukan yang ditulis `pack build` ke folder `.build/` sebuah paket.\n"
"Untuk cache pengembang di salinan kerja Didact (mypy, ruff, pytest, build paket),\n"
"gunakan `make clean`."

