#. command help: didact snapshot
#: didact/commands/care.py
msgid ""
"Zips the whole data home (all but its backups) into backups/. Ending a session\n"
"makes one too (snapshot-<time>-auto.zip), and only the newest five of those stay.\n"
"\n"
"--restore shows what a backup holds next to the library now. With --yes it backs\n"
"the library up as it is (snapshot-<time>-before-restore.zip), then puts the\n"
"backup's files in place of everything but the backups. Undo can't take a restore\n"
"back: restoring that backup can. Event and roll numbers carry on.\n"
"\n"
"--remove and --keep delete backups for good: they aren't part of the library's\n"
"history, so undo can't bring them back."
msgstr ""
"Memampatkan seluruh direktori data (kecuali cadangannya) ke dalam zip di backups/.\n"
"Mengakhiri sesi juga membuatnya (snapshot-<time>-auto.zip), dan hanya lima yang terbaru\n"
"yang disimpan.\n"
"\n"
"--restore menampilkan isi cadangan berdampingan dengan pustaka saat ini. Dengan --yes,\n"
"pustaka dicadangkan apa adanya (snapshot-<time>-before-restore.zip), lalu berkas\n"
"cadangan menggantikan semuanya kecuali cadangan. Urungkan tidak dapat membatalkan\n"
"pemulihan: memulihkan cadangan itu bisa. Nomor peristiwa dan lemparan tetap berlanjut.\n"
"\n"
"--remove dan --keep menghapus cadangan untuk selamanya: cadangan bukan bagian dari\n"
"riwayat pustaka, jadi urungkan tidak dapat mengembalikannya."

